  #line-at(274.8pt, 405.72pt, "4.")
  #line-at(291.72pt, 405.72pt, "conclusion ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 10.358pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.2pt, 437.04pt, "This pilot study was designed to explore the use of low-energy ion beams for preparing solid electrolytes in ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 451.2pt, "the form of ultrathin films, with the aim of advancing all-solid-state thin-film batteries. The results demonstrate ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 465.48pt, "the successful mitigation of the shuttle effect in the presence of LISICON, particularly with ferroic elements ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 479.76pt, "on the surface. Staircase voltammetry data from the PE separators coated with these films show a reduction in ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 494.04pt, "redox peaks and a decreased slope, indicating improved electrochemical performance. Polysulfide suppression ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 508.32pt, "is a crucial challenge for the widespread adoption of Li-S batteries, and the findings here suggest that it can ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 522.6pt, "significantly enhance energy storage capabilities. Based on these results, the combination of Ni and LAGP ")
  #line-at(79.2pt, 536.76pt, "coatings presents a promising direction for future research. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.358pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#0f4761"))
